# ---------------- TK_Gunner.events (Task 16 Part I follow-up) ----------------
# One sheet for every armed TK4 type: Pistolboy, ShotgunManiac, UziRebel, Commando,
# BazookaBoy, Punisher, Flamer, Punk, GrenadeGay.
#
# `enemy type my name` reads the actor's own name (the computed `my name`) and pulls that
# type's stats out of EnemyTypes.events, so this sheet never repeats a number: speed, sight
# distance, health, weapon and explosion death all come from the data table. Retune a type
# there and every actor named after it changes; add a type there and a scene actor named after
# it works with no new sheet.
#
# The held weapon decides the attack: `spawn Bullet` is sent through `my Weapon` (Task 16
# Part C), so a Pistolboy fires pistol rounds and a BazookaBoy launches a rocket. A type with
# an empty weapon (a melee type) bites instead. `my Hostile` gates every reaction, so a
# non-hostile type wearing this sheet never chases, hears or attacks.
#
# SETUP (editor): EventSheet on the enemy actor, Event File = TK_Gunner, and the actor named
# after its type (Flax allows several actors with the same name). A name that is not a type
# warns once, listing the types, and the enemy keeps its defaults.

when me appears
  enemy type my name
  set my mode to "patrol"
  # A gun changes the attack range: armed types shoot, unarmed ones bite.
  set my Armed to false
  if my Weapon is ""
  otherwise
  set my Armed to true
  goto random Waypoint speed my Speed facing forward

when me arrives at Waypoint
  my Speed is higher than 0                  # a rooted type never wanders
  wait random 0.5 to 2 seconds
  goto random Waypoint speed my Speed

# ---- sight: as far as this type's eyes reach, at this type's pace ----
when me sees player by my SightDistance
  my Hostile is true
  my Speed is higher than 0
  set my mode to "chase"
  goto nearest player speed my Speed facing forward

# ---- hearing (Task 16 Part B): a gunshot it can hear is a lead ----
when me hears "gunshot" by my SightDistance
  my Hostile is true
  set my mode to "chase"
  goto other speed my Speed facing forward

when every 0.2 seconds
  my mode is "chase"
  my Speed is higher than 0
  goto nearest player speed my Speed facing forward

when me stops seeing player
  set my mode to "patrol"
  goto random Waypoint speed my Speed facing forward

# ---- attack: the type's weapon, at the type's cadence ----
when every 0.75 seconds
  my mode is "chase"
  my Hostile is true
  my Armed is true
  face nearest player
  spawn Bullet at me offset 30

# An unarmed type has to close in: same bite Enemy.events uses.
when me is near player by 1.5
  my mode is "chase"
  my Hostile is true
  my Armed is false
  play anim "Attack"
  send message "hurt" to nearest player

# ---- damage and death (Parts C.5 + E + G) ----
when message "damage" arrives
  spawn Blood at me
  set my LastDmg to other's damage
  set my Health to my Health - my LastDmg

when my Health becomes 0
  add 1 to kills my Type
  if my ExplosionDeath is true
  spawn Explosion at me
  destroy me
  otherwise
  spawn Gib at me offset 0
  spawn Gib at me offset 12
  spawn Gib at me offset -12
  destroy me
